   "text": "Users\n\nGET    /users/me · /{authId}    GetUser\nPUT    /users/me                UpdateProfile\nDELETE /users/me · /{authId}    DeleteUser → 202\nGET    /users/closures/{id}     GetAccountClosure\nGET    …/{id}/history           …History\nPOST   …/{id}/cancel            WithdrawAccountClosure\n\nsagas  AccountClosureGracePeriod\n       AccountClosureSaga\nbus    Start · Remind · Complete · Cancel\nout    PublishUserEvents\nContracts/IUsersModule",
