   "x": 2854,
   "y": 5770,
   "width": 436.8,
   "height": 245,
   "text": "Tasks\n\nPOST   /tasks       CreateTask (idempotente)\nGET    /tasks       ListTasks (keyset)\nGET    /tasks/{id}  GetTask\nPUT    /tasks/{id}  UpdateTask\nDELETE /tasks/{id}  DeleteTask\ninternal task-count-snapshot  SnapshotTaskCounts\n\nbus  tasks.user-deletions     DeleteOwnedTasks\nbus  tasks.account-closures   Hold/ReleaseOwnerTasks\nout  PublishTaskEvents → tasks.task-events\n\nAccess/ · Persistence/TasksDbContext · Telemetry/",
   "originalText": "Tasks\n\nPOST   /tasks       CreateTask (idempotente)\nGET    /tasks       ListTasks (keyset)\nGET    /tasks/{id}  GetTask\nPUT    /tasks/{id}  UpdateTask\nDELETE /tasks/{id}  DeleteTask\ninternal task-count-snapshot  SnapshotTaskCounts\n\nbus  tasks.user-deletions     DeleteOwnedTasks\nbus  tasks.account-closures   Hold/ReleaseOwnerTasks\nout  PublishTaskEvents → tasks.task-events\n\nAccess/ · Persistence/TasksDbContext · Telemetry/",
